  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC023 (Prefer Find/FindAsync) no longer reports for entities with a visible global query filter. Find checks the change tracker before querying, and a tracker hit bypasses HasQueryFilter — so the FirstOrDefault(pk) to Find(pk) rewrite could silently resurrect soft-deleted or other-tenant rows. The gate keys on the DbSet's entity type (an Id inherited from a base class doesn't dodge it), walks base types (EF declares filters on the hierarchy root), and recognises OnModelCreating, EntityTypeBuilder configuration classes, and the non-generic Entity(typeof(X)).HasQueryFilter(...) form. Filters configured in another assembly remain invisible to the analyzer.",
